      "description": "Optional precision; blank is valid and no precision is invented.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-label\">Known date<input class=\"ds-input\" aria-describedby=\"ds-date-help\" placeholder=\"2026, 2026-10 or 2026-10-16\"></label><p id=\"ds-date-help\" class=\"ds-help\">Use YYYY, YYYY-MM or YYYY-MM-DD. Leave blank if unknown.</p>",
      "css": ".ds-label{display:block;color:var(--fg,#f2f3f5);font:16px/1.55 system-ui,sans-serif;margin:12px 0}.ds-input{display:block;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;padding:12px;margin:6px 0 24px;background:var(--field,#1d1f23);color:var(--fg,#f2f3f5);font:inherit;border:1px solid var(--control,#797f8a);border-radius:6px}.ds-input::placeholder{color:var(--muted,#afb3bb);opacity:1}.ds-input:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent,#ff9b55);outline-offset:4px}.ds-help{font:.88rem/1.55 system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--muted,#afb3bb)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Milestone row",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Title-anchored fixed SVG with optional month precision and description. Fictional specimen.",
      "html": "<ol class=\"ds-milestones\"><li><span class=\"ds-symbol\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m8 6-6 6 6 6m8-12 6 6-6 6m-3-15-2 18\"/></svg></span><div><h3><a href=\"#fictional-milestone\">Fictional independent release<svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10\"/></svg></a></h3><time datetime=\"2026-10\">October 2026</time><p>A fictional local-only credit.</p></div></li></ol>",
      "css": ".ds-milestones{list-style:none;padding:0;max-width:820px;margin:24px 0;color:var(--fg,#f2f3f5)}.ds-milestones>li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:24px minmax(0,1fr);gap:16px;padding:24px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border,#444952)}.ds-symbol{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;align-self:start;margin-top:3px;color:var(--accent,#ff9b55)}.ds-milestones h3{font:600 22px/1.3 Space,system-ui;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-milestones h3 a{display:inline;color:inherit;text-underline-offset:4px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-milestones h3 a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent,#ff9b55);outline-offset:4px}.ds-milestones h3 svg{margin-left:8px;vertical-align:middle}.ds-milestones time{display:block;color:var(--muted,#afb3bb);font:14px/1.55 system-ui,sans-serif;margin-top:8px}.ds-milestones p{max-width:68ch;margin:12px 0 0;font:16px/1.55 system-ui,sans-serif;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Retained edit comparison",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Saved fields wrap beside explicit recovery controls; no automatic resubmission.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-compare\"><p>Compare before saving again. Your edits are kept here.</p><dl><dt>Saved title</dt><dd>Fictional milestone</dd><dt>Saved status</dt><dd>draft</dd></dl><div class=\"ds-actions\"><button class=\"ds-secondary\">Use saved version</button><button class=\"ds-secondary\">Keep my edits</button></div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-compare{font:16px/1.55 system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--fg,#f2f3f5);padding-block:16px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-compare dt{font-weight:600}.ds-compare dd{margin:0 0 16px;white-space:pre-wrap}.ds-actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}.ds-secondary{font:600 15px/1.55 system-ui,sans-serif;padding:12px 20px;min-height:48px;border:1px solid var(--control,#797f8a);border-radius:8px;background:var(--surface,#23252a);color:var(--fg,#f2f3f5);cursor:pointer}.ds-secondary:hover{filter:brightness(1.1)}.ds-secondary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent,#ff9b55);outline-offset:4px}"
